    "title": "Big Eat Fish Games Shark Games",
    "description": "Shark Games are real hunting games online to hunt big fishes in an eat fish game. Our new hungry fish shark games and fish games to play now on your mobile phone. The story of these shark games and fishing games is very interesting. You must go deeper into the ocean and dive underwater to find rare fish in the ocean, big eat fish, and win the fish games. There will be different types of fish in the aquarium's water games. which includes Dolphin, Shark catfish, Whale, Blue Whale, Bream, Anchovy, and Dogfish. You are a small baby shark fish in the big ocean, you are feeling very hungry like a hungry fish shark big eat fish games. You will need to eat big fishes to feed yourself in fishing games online. By eating fish you are becoming so fat and in the end, you eat the boss' big eating fish games.\r\n\r\nFree excitement-eating fish games online are coming to town. Eatfish.io includes all kinds of shark fishes in the aquarium. They attack each other to become the most powerful ones in the hungry fish shark games online. Big shark fish eat small fish to be giant fish in the free fishing games. Giant fish eat big fishes and turn over the Mega fish. Mega fish eat giant fish and finally become legendary fish in shark fish games online.\r\n\r\nYou will be given a number of shark fish in fishing games online. There will be a lot of fish with a higher number than you in the eat fish shark games. There will be smaller ones too. You will focus on eating fish with a smaller number in online games. In case you try to eat a shark fish with a higher number so you will lose the fish game level. When you eat a shark in the fishing games online, you become bigger and in the end, you will be able to eat the blue whale, like this you can win the fish games.\r\n\r\nThe fishing games are becoming more and more interesting. The reason the fishing games are becoming more survival games is that we are adding new features like animation, sounds, and music in the fishing games and hungry fish shark games. The fish games can be easily played on your smartphone. because it has very smooth control to play the fish games without any problem. An Internet connection is required to play the shark games with fun fishing games. You can easily play and enjoy shark games now on your mobile phone. \r\n\r\n\u25cf It is completely free-to-play supported by ads.\r\n\u25cf Try not to be destroyed and survive by bigger fishes\r\n\u25cf Discover and devour wild fish from the deep with your shark games\r\n\u25cf Explore an open world both above and below the waves as a hunter in free fish games\r\n\u25cf Use the revive button for the first failed attempt and be back to the aquarium in the fishing games\r\n\u25cf Explore an exciting aquatic world with sharks that each has its own personality",
    "descriptionHTML": "Shark Games are real hunting games online to hunt big fishes in an eat fish game. Our new hungry fish shark games and fish games to play now on your mobile phone. The story of these shark games and fishing games is very interesting. You must go deeper into the ocean and dive underwater to find rare fish in the ocean, big eat fish, and win the fish games. There will be different types of fish in the aquarium&#39;s water games. which includes Dolphin, Shark catfish, Whale, Blue Whale, Bream, Anchovy, and Dogfish. You are a small baby shark fish in the big ocean, you are feeling very hungry like a hungry fish shark big eat fish games. You will need to eat big fishes to feed yourself in fishing games online. By eating fish you are becoming so fat and in the end, you eat the boss&#39; big eating fish games.<br><br>Free excitement-eating fish games online are coming to town. Eatfish.io includes all kinds of shark fishes in the aquarium. They attack each other to become the most powerful ones in the hungry fish shark games online. Big shark fish eat small fish to be giant fish in the free fishing games. Giant fish eat big fishes and turn over the Mega fish. Mega fish eat giant fish and finally become legendary fish in shark fish games online.<br><br>You will be given a number of shark fish in fishing games online. There will be a lot of fish with a higher number than you in the eat fish shark games. There will be smaller ones too. You will focus on eating fish with a smaller number in online games. In case you try to eat a shark fish with a higher number so you will lose the fish game level. When you eat a shark in the fishing games online, you become bigger and in the end, you will be able to eat the blue whale, like this you can win the fish games.<br><br>The fishing games are becoming more and more interesting. The reason the fishing games are becoming more survival games is that we are adding new features like animation, sounds, and music in the fishing games and hungry fish shark games. The fish games can be easily played on your smartphone. because it has very smooth control to play the fish games without any problem. An Internet connection is required to play the shark games with fun fishing games. You can easily play and enjoy shark games now on your mobile phone. <br><br>\u25cf It is completely free-to-play supported by ads.<br>\u25cf Try not to be destroyed and survive by bigger fishes<br>\u25cf Discover and devour wild fish from the deep with your shark games<br>\u25cf Explore an open world both above and below the waves as a hunter in free fish games<br>\u25cf Use the revive button for the first failed attempt and be back to the aquarium in the fishing games<br>\u25cf Explore an exciting aquatic world with sharks that each has its own personality",
